[00:00.000]作词 : David Kushner/Alexander 23
[00:00.000][by:lilbabeJas_]
[00:01.000]作曲 : David Kushner/Alexander 23
[00:16.150]I know that you're waiting for me like a dog
[00:16.150]我知道你像小狗一样苦苦等待我
[00:22.630]But have some patience for the part of me that's lost
[00:22.630]但请你对已迷失的那部分我保持耐心吧
[00:29.290]There's been a hundred times when I don't recognize
[00:29.290]曾有成百上千次我无法认清我的心意
[00:32.510]Any of you that love me
[00:32.510]无法认清深爱着我的你
[00:35.770]I try to memorize and identify
[00:35.770]我尝试着回想并且看清
[00:39.170]But it's all getting foggy
[00:39.170]但前路迷雾重重
[00:40.890]My head is in the clouds right now
[00:40.890]我的思绪飘忽不定
[00:47.470]Just pray I come around, around
[00:47.470]祈求自己回心转意
[00:56.560]Hello, hello, are you lonely?
[00:56.560]你呀 你呀 是否觉得很孤独呢？
[00:59.880]I'm sorry, it's just the chemicals
[00:59.880]我深表歉意 这只是我们之间的化学感应罢了
[01:03.150]Hello, hello, do you know me?
[01:03.150]你呀 你呀 你真的了解我吗？
[01:06.540]I'm called Mr. Forgettable
[01:06.540]我可是易被遗忘之人
